<title>FRANCE: French EdF to cut prices by 14 pct by year 2000.</title>
<headline>French EdF to cut prices by 14 pct by year 2000.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new contract between French utility Electricite de France and the state signed on Tuesday allows for a cut in prices of 14 percent by the year 2000.</p>
<p>The cut in tariffs cut and the 1997-2000 contract signing were announced in a joint statement from the utility and the finance and industry ministries.</p>
</text>
